# PageHeader

> Lede 0.7.0's docs for PageHeader, installed with it. Setup, and every item in the release: [README.md](README.md). Online: https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/page-header.md

A screen's `<h1>` and its one-line summary, with an optional back link and actions. The heading takes focus on mount unless `focusOnMount` is false.

## Install

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @lede/page-header @lede/button
```

The command needs Lede's registry in `components.json`, as [README.md](README.md#use-it-in-a-shadcn-project) shows. It also installs the items [`lede-theme`](lede-theme.md) and [`lede-utils`](lede-utils.md). It adds [`button`](https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/button.md) only because the example below imports it. The item's JSON, with each file's source, is https://lede.cloudcompute.com/r/v0.7.0/page-header.json.

## Import

```tsx
import { PageHeader } from '@/components/lede/blocks/page-header';
```

